WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,320
It's better than dying outside. I agree.

2
00:00:08,350 --> 00:00:10,590
Say so using panels and backpacks

3
00:00:10,710 --> 00:00:12,470
Didn’t I just get six more backpacks?

4
00:00:12,750 --> 00:00:13,710
Don't worry now

5
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:15,510
There is no room for supplies in a room of ten square meters.

6
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:19,380
Lord Landlord

7
00:00:19,540 --> 00:00:21,620
Now can you show me your talent?

8
00:00:23,660 --> 00:00:25,540
Much more comfortable than the cold floor

9
00:00:25,740 --> 00:00:27,140
I slept on the floor yesterday

10
00:00:27,300 --> 00:00:30,380
It feels like my waist and cervical vertebrae are about to break.

11
00:00:30,580 --> 00:00:37,220
It's too high. It's outrageous.

12
00:00:40,670 --> 00:00:42,420
And this is the first-level effect

13
00:00:45,670 --> 00:00:46,990
It's indeed a bit excessive

14
00:00:47,110 --> 00:00:48,470
But it’s not particularly excessive

15
00:00:48,470 --> 00:00:50,390
The output of my talent
